   "section": "mod-tome/data/birth/classes/psionic.lua",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "This knowledge comes with a heavy price and the Solipsist must guard his thoughts, lest he come to believe that the world exists only within his own mind.",
   "target": "使用此理论需要付出巨大的代价，织梦者必须对自己的思维有很强的控制力，否则他会渐渐相信这世界只存在于他自己的心智之中。",
