  {
   "id": "51941c079f56",
   "unit_id": "51941c079f566448c8852949c6cf9fe3b449d4bfbe392a1cfeacc34d2e94bc88",
   "revision_key": "6168b55459d29708e4be4655bad56df4e7c8581a659f30b6037dc49016f85f07",
   "translation_file": "mod-tome.lua",
   "translation_line": 3088,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/birth/classes/rogue.lua",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "The wilds of Maj'Eyal are not a safe place. Untamed beasts and wandering dragons may seem a great threat, but the true perils walk on two legs. Thieves and brigands, assassins and opportunistic adventurers, even mad wizards and magic-hating zealots all carry danger to those who venture beyond the safety of city walls.",
   "target": "埃亚尔的野外不是个安全的地方。野兽和到处游荡的龙似乎是巨大的威胁，然而真正危险的是两条腿的人。窃贼、强盗、刺客、投机冒险家、疯狂的巫师，甚至憎恶魔法的狂热者，都会给那些走出安全城墙的冒险者带来危险。",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/birth/classes/rogue.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
    167
   ],
   "previously_reviewed": {
    "A": false,
    "B": false
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "7f5005fe4745",
   "unit_id": "7f5005fe4745b82b7e6c0c27eaa81a595eecdad384beb11233a0cfe5c4016910",
   "revision_key": "09db6a7a23ece26023611f3a90e4a4d4b0fa98b4bdabff2a15221fa822e29525",
   "translation_file": "mod-tome.lua",
   "translation_line": 3089,
   "section": "mod-tome/data/birth/classes/rogue.lua",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Amidst this chaos wanders one class of rogue that has learned to take by force rather than subterfuge. With refined techniques, agile feats and brawn-backed blades the Marauder seeks out his targets and removes them by the most direct methods. He uses dual weapons backed by advanced combat training to become highly effective in battle, and he is unafraid to use the dirtiest tactics when the odds are against him.",
   "target": "在这混乱之中诞生了一种特殊的盗贼，他们擅于正面交锋而不是使用诡计。拥有精准特技、灵巧步伐和锋利刀刃的掠夺者搜寻他的目标并直接消灭他们。他们通过高等战斗训练使双持武器更加有效，情形不利时他们不会忌讳使用肮脏的手段取得胜利。",
   "source_file": "game/modules/tome/data/birth/classes/rogue.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": [
    168
   ],
   "previously_reviewed": {
    "A": false,
